{"text": "On a sunny afternoon, Jemima flew to the wood for the last time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The gentleman was sitting on a log, and he looked nervous. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look at your eggs, and then give me the herbs, Be quick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He spoke more sharply than before, and Jemima felt surprised and uncomfortable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While Jemima was inside the shed, someone with a black nose locked the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After terrible barking and howling, nobody ever saw the foxy whiskered gentleman again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kep opened the door of the shed and let Jemima out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sadly, the puppies rushed in and ate up all the eggs before Kep could stop them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima went home in tears because her eggs were gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In June she laid some more eggs, and this time she could keep them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But only four of them hatched, and Jemima said it was because of her nerves.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "a", " ", "s", "u", "n", "n", "y", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", ",", " ", "J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "t", "l", "e", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "g", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "n", "e", "r", "v", "o", "u", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "o", "o", "k", " ", "a", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "e", "g", "g", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t